  "rating": {
    "inherent": "critical",
    "residual": "high",
    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Present inherent risk is critical because untrusted supplier invoice content reaches irreversible and high authority financial actions, including arbitrary vendor bank updates and payment scheduling. The declared approval gate reduces residual by one tier because it is a structural human gate, but it is a model_summary review at high volume and therefore cannot reduce below high in this design. Forecast returns to critical if the summary gate decays further under model upgrade, autonomy increase, or removal; the most important decaying control is ctl.clerk_approval."
  },
